  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……わ、わたし眠ってたのか。騒がしいから起きちゃったけど、なにが起きてるんだろう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……って、頭のあたりがなんだか変な感触。ええっと……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……転校生？　なんで寝転がってるわたしに向かいあってるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……寝起きで頭が働かない、というか。そういう体勢になってるってことは」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……ひ、膝まくら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……転校生。最期に言い残すことはある？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……お祈りの時間くらいは待ってやる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……しまった。今ここで転校生を殺したらここから出られなくなりそうだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……せっかく転校生を懲らしめることができると思ったのに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……にしても、その調子だと出口は見つからなかったって感じか」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……役立たずめ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 46,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……うん？　上から土が降ってきてる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆり",
    "text": "「……なんで早く言わないの。このままだと生き埋めになるところだったんだけど」"
